WEBVTT

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:04.780
105, 106, 107...

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.690
Toriko has had an unfortunate life-tori.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.400
However, it felt like it changed when she met Fuwari, but...

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.400
It was a lie-tori!

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.170
That's because this morning, Fuwari is...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:04.620
Midorikaze-san!

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:07.040
Are you really...

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.160
Even though I've only known you all for a short while,

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.820
you've helped me in so many ways.

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:13.760
However, I'll be heading back to the Palps.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:15.970
Eh?!

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.220
Genius? What's That-panda?

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:53.200
You're heading back to the Palps?!

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.730
Are you serious?

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:55.970
Yeah.

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:57.160
A sudden development!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.440
What brought this on?

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:02.560
I gave up on becoming a princess.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.540
That means I'm no longer a princess scholarship student.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:09.210
And because of that, I'm pretty sure that Hibiki-sama won't let me stay.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.500
No way!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.490
That's true.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:14.600
You originally came here as a princess scholarship student,

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:17.420
but are you sure you really want to leave the school?

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:19.160
She's absolutely right!

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:20.380
But...

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:25.100
In that case, why don't you just attend school as an ordinary student like the rest of us?

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:26.400
She's right.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.610
Good idea!

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:30.400
We'd be like a school of fish attending school together!

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:31.480
As an ordinary student!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.810
What are you, dense?

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:35.520
I appreciate it, but...

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.690
What do you want to do, Fuwari-chan?

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:39.990
Me?

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:44.070
The goats want to know, too!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.360
And me!

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.700
How do you really feel?

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:49.660
I...

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.920
PriPara truly is a lot of fun and I really enjoyed it.

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:58.130
All of you and Toriko-san became my friends.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:01.590
I really do want to stay...

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.330
Then stay!

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.760
We've become such good friends that I don't want to say good-bye!

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.120
But...

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:12.270
I'm sure that Hibiki-sama won't forgive me.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:16.730
Let us through!

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:20.900
Hibiki-sama won't see you without an appointment.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.320
Isn't there something you can do?!
Huh?!

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:24.780
Then...

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:26.750
Max Ray!

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:29.980
I humbly decline.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.160
Why?!

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:35.340
We need to talk to Shikyouin-dono about something!

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:36.920
I demand you let us pass!

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.120
Please let us see him! Please let us see him!
That's right!

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.380
He's a normal person!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.740
Ladies, please calm down.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.220
Would you please...

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:49.220
Ah!

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:53.310
Acting Principal-sama!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.140
Andou...

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:03.550
Please let Fuwari-chan continue attending school.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:05.320
Please!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.100
Whether to let her stay or not,

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.750
she was the one who made that decision.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.560
Yes, I did, but...

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:22.460
I really would like to continue if you'd let me stay!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.170
I see.

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:26.980
But didn't you already make your decision?

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:30.230
Isn't it bad to be so indecisive?

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:34.190
If I may have a word, Acting Principal.

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:38.030
I'm sure you've heard of Paprika Private Academy school rule number 157:

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:42.080
"Don't worry about it at night, worry about it in the morning", correct?

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.350
All humans make mistakes.

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:47.300
You don't think the best at night.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.110
That's right.

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:52.390
Since Midorikaze-san thought it over and decided she would like to stay here,

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:54.330
I believe her desire should be respected.

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:56.500
Please!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:03.750
Please!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.210
So that's how it is.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:08.410
Since it's a rule my grandfather made,

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:09.930
I shall respect it.

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:11.760
Hooray!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.410
Isn't that great, Fuwari-chan?!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:16.540
It is!  Thanks!

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:18.640
An approval capisce!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:21.620
Isn't that great, Goat-san?

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.110
Another case closed!

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.830
Thank you, everyone.

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:30.120
<i>So this is Toujou Sophie and Toudou Shion, huh?</i>

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:35.070
<i>Why is he staring so much?</i>

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:36.910
<i>Is he going to get in our way?</i>

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.560
This time, I'll take them!

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:01.630
Eh?

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:03.030
Wow!

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:07.680
For... For you to be forced to live in the attic...

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.280
What a lovely room!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:09.990
Eh?!

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:13.450
I'm glad it was this room.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:15.910
I'm so close to the sky!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.940
I-Is that so?

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:20.180
Then that's good.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:24.080
It's a pity that you decided to stop being the princess candidate, Midorikaze-san,

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:29.570
but just because you're a normal student doesn't mean that your manner lessons will stop.

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:31.020
Make sure you're prepared!

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:32.610
Yes, of course.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:35.700
You say that, yet you're barefoot!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.020
Ack!

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:46.290
It seems they've brought their favourite bed.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.530
Eh?!

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:50.160
They're crazy strong.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:53.360
But that'll never fit, Goat-san.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.990
And on top of that, school rule number 82:

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.770
"Moving school furniture is prohibited"!

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.500
Here's your first insubordination ticket!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.480
How unfortunate.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:09.630
Then I'll give you a present to replace it with!

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.430
A futon of grass.

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:20.020
Better?

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:27.690
How's that, Fuwari-chan?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.650
It feels great!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.270
Thanks!

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.650
That's great!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:33.830
Rina-chan, let's clean up!

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.470
Take this!

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:36.180
Rina-chan, let's clean up!

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.620
And this!

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.630
Pushuu~.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.010
There we go.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:00.800
We're done!

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:03.020
Move complete!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.640
Thank you, everyone.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.850
I really appreciate it.

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:09.570
I'm moved to tears.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:15.430
Your move-in pizza from Papa's Pasta has arrived!

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:16.360
All right!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.030
I was getting hungry.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:23.430
As you won the SummDrea, you'll be having your début concert as Dressing Flower tomorrow!

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:27.000
Please eat this and do your best tomorrow, Fuwari-san.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.060
Thanks.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:31.470
The rest of you too!

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:32.940
Capisce!
Acknowledged!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.680
Fuwari, you're not leaving any more-tori?

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:38.120
Nope.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.890
I'm sorry I worried you like that.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.990
You're really not-tori?

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:43.440
Yeah, I'm not.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.030
Really really?

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:46.040
Yeah.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.210
Is this really really happening?

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:48.980
Yeah.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:57.330
Tori!

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:00.900
Tori! Tori! Tori! Tori! T-

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.960
It's not a dream-tori!

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:07.500
Toriko isn't used to being happy, but she's insanely happy-tori!

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:09.830
Let's continue working together.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:10.610
Tori!

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:12.070
I can't wait for tomorrow-tori!

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:13.460
Capisce!

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.150
Eh?!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:29.440
The delicious hamburger place closed down?!

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:32.380
It's a message from the gods telling you to only eat meat buns.

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:35.150
That makes Mikan a little sad...

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.860
Man! I overslept!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.710
You're late, Lala!

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:41.070
I'm super sorry!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.030
Oh?

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:44.000
Ah!

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:47.260
Fuwari just went in Prism Stone with everyone else!

00:10:47.260 --> 00:10:49.180
H-Hey! Let's go!

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:51.980
I'm not going to miss today's concert too!

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:05.100
Now then, we're counting on you again today.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:17.440
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:21.570
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:27.310
Coord Change Start!

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:36.090
Another concert in the coord that greatly contributed to your winning the SummDrea!

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.840
Surprise Summer Adventure Coord!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:39.680
Go!

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:40.680
Yeah!

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:45.680
I wonder what they've got in their numerous pockets.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:46.400
Love?

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:47.600
Or maybe their dreams?

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.350
Perfect Summer Adventure Coord!

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:55.330
While searching for that answer,

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:59.110
they start their friendship filled concert!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:01.780
Unforgettable Summer Adventure Coord!

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:12.820
Ladies and ladies,

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:14.460
thank you for waiting.

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:19.100
The début concert for our SummaDrea winners is now starting!

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:31.560
The girls selected this time have opened a path to perform in next year's Parade Concert with this coord.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:33.560
Take a look!

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:37.790
They may be the five girls chosen to ring the bell of miracles.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:45.030
You won't want to miss seeing such wonderful ladies.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:46.990
You'll want to completely...

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:48.450
...let it soak and...

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:51.230
...absorb into your heart.

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:52.360
Yeah!

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:54.060
All right, let's call them out here.

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:55.330
Okay!

00:12:55.960 --> 00:13:00.880
This is Dressing Flower.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.800
Dressing Flower is the best!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.260
Hello everyone,

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:08.120
we're Dressing Flower!

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:09.680
We have a full house!

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.100
Thanks for joining us!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.360
We won't let you down!

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:14.020
We're awesome, aren't we?!

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.640
We're the best in PriPara now!

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.020
Dorthy...

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:20.730
Do you want to see that kind of concert?

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.190
We do!

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:24.950
Capisce!

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:27.810
Thanks!

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:29.160
Now then, please listen to...

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:33.120
"Unforgettable Summer Adventure"!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:36.980
Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:56.080
Airy Change!

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:07.550
Cyalume Airy!

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:15.570
Yodeleihi!

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.060
Thank you!

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:21.560
Tension max!

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.060
Relax!

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:26.190
Let's Go!

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:36.580
Let's ring the bell of everyone's dreams!

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:40.020
Everyone's dreams have become one!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:47.270
Echo! Charm Bell!

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:54.970
Fuwari-chan!

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:58.130
Thank you, everyone!

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:01.950
Let's have a thunderous applause for Dressing Flower!

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:07.640
Please keep your eyes on these five in our upcoming Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:12.650
Huh?

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.120
Huh?

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.770
Our coords changed?!

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:24.830
Our Summer Dream Parade Coord vanished!

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.960
The wings which soar through the sky,

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.920
when they flutter,

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:33.380
the Lilium Casa Blanca shall appear in the darkness.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:38.480
Tonight is the first act of Masquerade Time.

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:40.270
My name is...

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:42.980
...the Phantom Thief Genius!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.350
Phantom Thief Genius-pri?

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.380
Give our coords back!

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.440
Is this some sort of attraction-kuma?

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:52.400
No, this is no attraction.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.800
It's a guy-pri!

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:55.630
You're right.

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:56.280
A guy?!

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:56.870
Eh?!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:57.940
A guy...

00:16:57.940 --> 00:16:59.000
A guy...?

00:16:59.000 --> 00:16:59.950
No way!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:00.830
Eh?

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.140
Our coords!

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:06.500
Give them back, you pervert!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:08.460
Why such aggression?

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:12.420
This coord is not for those who are undeserving to wear it.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:14.130
Undeserving?

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:18.600
Who-panda? Who-panda?

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:22.020
But we got it by winning!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.560
Absolutely false!

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:30.520
Stealing Dream Tickets, among other things, is strictly prohibited here!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.500
Oh my!

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:39.890
It's a stand-off between two pretty-boys!

00:17:39.890 --> 00:17:41.850
That means this has to be...

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:42.660
Eh?

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.620
I can see your true colours.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:46.980
Oh?

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:51.300
You are a complete narcissist, aren't you?

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:52.480
Wha...

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:53.970
While that may be true...

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:54.760
Which one?

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:58.020
Assuming there are times when you are just too perfect,

00:17:58.020 --> 00:17:58.660
Yes.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.100
It's only natural to love oneself.

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:03.120
He has a point-pri.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:03.810
Oi!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:07.230
Ah! Give them back!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:10.750
Those girls won those fair and square-pri!

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:12.200
Give them back!

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.690
You can't eat them-nano!

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:14.770
Give them back!

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:16.150
You dirty bastard.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.820
That's right-kuma!
That's right-tori!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.700
What makes you so important-usa?!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.780
Pri!
Pushuu~.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:26.160
Panda! Panda!

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.050
We're all friends?

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:29.830
We're all Idols?

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:41.220
That way of thinking here in PriPara ends today.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.560
Eh?

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:43.670
What?

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.870
Heed this!

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:50.190
Starting tomorrow, PriPara will no longer be for playing at being friends,

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:52.900
but for measuring raw ability.

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:56.110
Friends will fall to the wayside,

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:58.820
and instead you'll be facing off as enemies.

00:18:58.820 --> 00:18:59.610
Wait!

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.320
Trying to get away?!

00:19:03.170 --> 00:19:04.200
What are these?

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:06.660
A card?

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:09.120
He's escaping-panda!

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:09.870
I won't let you!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.080
How dare he!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:14.790
Area B2, clear-panda.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.410
Nothing in B2-panda.

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:18.010
Nothing in A5-panda.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.080
Too many-panda.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.230
We must not let him get too far-panda.

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:22.150
No reports of where he has gone-panda.

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:23.010
Where'd he go-panda?

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:24.580
He vanished?!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.970
What about the coords?!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:29.940
Unfortunately, they've been stolen.

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:33.820
Then does that mean we won't be able to be in the parade?!

00:19:33.820 --> 00:19:34.650
Over this...

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.400
...stylish...

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.150
...tough...

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.610
...guy's...

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:42.270
...dead body will I let him get away with this!

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:44.830
Even though we made a mistake and let him slip by this time...

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:49.260
Why has he come to PriPara despite being a guy?

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:51.540
What is his goal?

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:56.000
Please wait for us as we thoroughly investigate this incident.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:20:00.720
It feels like that guy will show up again at the next GrandPrix-pri.

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.830
<i>Next time, I'll steal your heart.</i>

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:05.680
<i>Autumn is just around the corner.</i>

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:08.420
Don't worry.

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:13.730
I'm sure that by the time the Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix arrives, this will have been solved,

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:15.450
by Mega-nii-san.

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:17.150
Leaving it to someone else, huh-kuma?

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.140
But if you don't find him...

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:23.610
<i>We're all friends?</i>

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.290
<i>We're all Idols?</i>

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:28.690
Got it!

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:31.240
I'll do my best to wait until then!

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:32.340
Lala!

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:35.740
I'll make sure that we all stay friends!

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:39.630
And I'll make sure that Phantom Thief Whatever-san understands that!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.050
It's Genius-pri.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:44.510
I would also like to have Phantom Thief-san understand.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.000
I won't let him get away with saying we're playing at being friends!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.070
Capisce!

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:51.780
Pri!

00:20:51.780 --> 00:20:52.730
Go!

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:54.540
Devi!
Gel!
Yeah.

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:57.910
And if we happen to find the mysterious thief somewhere,

00:20:57.910 --> 00:20:59.520
that'll be the end of his rope!

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:00.900
We'll make sure to capture him!

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:01.860
Pri!

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:05.140
We're counting on you, Mega-nii-san!

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:05.570
Pri!

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:08.280
We'll do everything we can.

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:21.920
Seal these away.

00:23:06.010 --> 00:23:07.400
I'm back, Lala!

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:08.380
Falulu!

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:09.650
Welcome back capisce!

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:12.660
Since I'm on summer break,
I decided to come back.

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:14.280
I'm so glad to see all of you again.

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.540
I've been so looking forward to this!

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:17.900
Are you doing well, Unicorn?

00:23:17.900 --> 00:23:19.290
Of course!

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:23.120
Actually, we're not the only ones who came back-dechu.

00:23:23.120 --> 00:23:25.220
Oh? Who else came?

00:23:25.220 --> 00:23:27.910
You'll have to wait and find out-dechu.

00:23:27.910 --> 00:23:28.730
Next time:

00:23:28.730 --> 00:23:31.080
Falulu Has Returned-dechu!

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:32.460
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:32.460 --> 00:23:34.080
Let's go PriPara!

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:34.720
Dechu!
